flowchart TD
  subgraph TaskManager
    T1([Start]) --> T2[Create recording task: target, deadline] --> T3[Assign to one or more Speakers]
  end
  subgraph Speaker
    S1[Claim next sentence pair] --> S2[Record cs version] --> S3[Record vi version] --> S4[Upload]
  end
  T3 --> S1
  subgraph System
    Y1[ffmpeg normalize 16 kHz mono WAV + auto-QC] --> Y2{QC passed?}
    Y2 -- No --> Y3[recording qc_failed] --> S1
    Y2 -- Yes --> Y4[recording pending_review; added to review tasks]
    Y4 --> Y5[Recompute task status]
  end
  S4 --> Y1
  Y5 --> E([End])
